{"about_the_game":"The protagonist, Tenka Kurono, is an adopted son of the Kurono family, who has been managing the Kuromiya Shrine for several generations. His older sister Mutsuki and upperclassman Rinna are runemasters - prana users who have been defending the land of commoners since ancient times. Alas, Tenka himself has no special powers, but his daily life is about to be shattered when he starts hearing his name being called in a dream...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWish is a doujin game, or Indie game, coming to you straight from the fan and story-telling community of Japan! An \u201cEastern romance visual novel,\u201d Wish combines the best of supernatural, battle, and human elements in order to create an awesome visual novel.  It was Studio Migiha's first title, and if it's well received we may localize more episodes of this title!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Prologue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/392370/1b7bb849648d57d126766994445f1ba8e1d3760f.jpg"},{"name":"The Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/392370/c995b501c123b52f88c24c6423470b07cae8408f.jpg"},{"name":"Master Chef Rinna","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/392370/9ab220f20367f6c6d5007c52611ec1bb8fba2198.jpg"},{"name":"How's dem apples?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/392370/dd62cdea083cf15ca1dad1124159a4c95401e33b.jpg"},{"name":"Taking responsibility.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/392370/33b0d9f202278539a9b9295d407933c002466efe.jpg"},{"name":"The Ayakashi Suppression","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/392370/d591f6c5d2551968292a5b4e1879c33fd42104ce.jpg"},{"name":"Three-move Battle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/392370/2274c186c63917ca5cf147ec35dae54faac6e7ba.jpg"},{"name":"Min